Runtime code coverage of the VIDEO path — 2026-09-10

METHOD  `cargo llvm-cov run --no-report` accumulated over 40 instrumented
        encodes: 5 sequences x presets {0,6,8,13} x cli_qp {20,55}, then one
        `cargo llvm-cov report`. Sequences are the varied set in
        video_varied_content_2026-09-10.meta (camera portrait/landscape, screen
        content in motion, 200x120 non-64-aligned, 576x448 past R360p).

HEADLINE  36.84 % region coverage (123,508 regions, 78,008 missed) from video
        alone, against the workspace test suite's 91.83 % floor. That gap is
        EXPECTED and is not a defect: video exercises one arm of an encoder that
        also carries stills, HDR, mono, alpha, 10-bit, superres and tiles. The
        number is useful only as a map of which VIDEO code is cold.

